  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #29366f;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --accent: #41a6f6;\n  --accent-dark: #2a6fb0;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  line-height: 1;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 72px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-dark);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n#reset {\n  background: var(--text);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\n#reset:hover {\n  background: #d0d0d0;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  #count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    min-width: 64px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction render() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndocument.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  render();\n});\n\nrender();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial value: 0\n- Increase (+1), decrease (-1), and reset (0) buttons\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled buttons\n- Responsive layout down to 360px\n- Cohesive 5-color palette and pixel-inspired card design\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Click or focus the buttons and press Enter/Space to change the count.\n3. The current integer is shown in the `#count` output element.\n\n## Controls\n\n- **Increase**: adds 1 to the count\n- **Decrease**: subtracts 1 from the count\n- **Reset**: sets the count back to 0\n\nAll buttons have visible hover, focus, and pressed states.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – markup and required element IDs\n- `style.css` – pixel-style theming and responsive layout\n- `script.js` – counter logic using `addEventListener`\n\n## Notes\n\n- Works fully offline.\n- No inline event handlers, imports, packages, or external assets.\n- Total source is under 200 lines.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
